      "outdated": true
    },
    {
      "by": "cubic-dev-ai",
      "ask": "`supervise_output` installs its signal handlers only after starting the command. A direct SIGINT/SIGTERM in that window can terminate the supervisor without forwarding shutdown, orphaning the child; block these signals during setup or install a temporary handler before spawning.",
